WEBVTT

01:36.570 --> 01:39.990
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.130 --> 01:42.009
[Episode 18]

02:00.420 --> 02:01.380
There's some more here.

02:02.700 --> 02:04.180
Here.

02:04.190 --> 02:05.600
I forgot I left it in my pocket.

02:10.259 --> 02:12.200
Boss, Haihong.

02:14.170 --> 02:15.870
You haven't eaten?

02:16.110 --> 02:17.829
This is not much.

02:17.829 --> 02:18.910
You can use it first.

02:18.910 --> 02:19.990
No, no.

02:19.990 --> 02:21.829
You need it yourself too.

02:21.829 --> 02:22.270
No.

02:22.270 --> 02:23.350
No, take it.

02:23.350 --> 02:24.190
Boss.

02:24.320 --> 02:25.030
This matter

02:25.070 --> 02:27.420
happened because of this 10,000 yuan.

02:27.570 --> 02:29.890
As her mother, I made a mistake.

02:29.920 --> 02:30.800
I didn't stop her

02:30.829 --> 02:32.300
from doing such a stupid thing,

02:32.329 --> 02:34.010
implicating Wanghe.

02:34.020 --> 02:36.040
Wanghe did it for Fenghua.

02:36.070 --> 02:37.390
So take it.

02:37.420 --> 02:39.150
Saving the child is more important.

02:39.510 --> 02:41.310
As you know,

02:41.310 --> 02:42.430
our money is on the goods.

02:42.430 --> 02:42.960
Yes.

02:42.960 --> 02:43.840
Yes, we...

02:43.950 --> 02:45.230
Gathering money?

02:46.890 --> 02:47.730
Here.

02:48.710 --> 02:49.430
What are you doing?

02:49.430 --> 02:50.829
You always meddle when something happens.

02:50.829 --> 02:52.150
Your money didn't fall from the sky.

02:52.150 --> 02:53.910
No, it's an emergency.

02:54.310 --> 02:55.390
Why are you talking so much?

02:55.390 --> 02:56.550
Take it. I'm leaving.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.860
Don't worry, Haihong.

03:01.860 --> 03:02.550
Sorry.

03:02.550 --> 03:04.180
We're really sorry.

03:04.180 --> 03:05.030
Don't worry.

03:05.030 --> 03:05.750
Yanzi.

03:06.030 --> 03:06.990
Let's stop at that.

03:06.990 --> 03:08.350
I won't stand on ceremony.

03:08.350 --> 03:09.190
I'll take

03:09.430 --> 03:10.310
this money.

03:10.670 --> 03:11.310
Also,

03:11.750 --> 03:12.910
I remember

03:13.110 --> 03:14.430
everyone's kindness.

03:14.430 --> 03:15.430
We'll pay you back later.

03:15.430 --> 03:16.430
No need.

03:16.990 --> 03:19.110
We should pay for it.

03:19.110 --> 03:20.870
Don't worry.

03:20.870 --> 03:22.790
Eat first. Your health is more important.

03:23.190 --> 03:24.190
I'm leaving.

03:25.910 --> 03:27.430
Hurry up and eat.

03:31.430 --> 03:32.310
Give it a count.

03:34.030 --> 03:35.350
How much?

03:36.190 --> 03:37.230
Siyi.

03:38.270 --> 03:38.950
Grandma.

03:40.790 --> 03:42.790
This is 2,000 yuan.

03:43.630 --> 03:44.750
It's not much.

03:45.190 --> 03:47.150
It's just to show our sincerity.

03:47.420 --> 03:49.230
Take it to Ms. Liang.

03:50.030 --> 03:50.829
Go.

03:51.590 --> 03:52.750
I can't take this.

03:52.750 --> 03:54.270
You owe too much. You don't want to live anymore?

03:54.270 --> 03:56.110
We are lending this to you. Not like you're not returning this.

03:56.110 --> 03:56.910
Right?

03:56.910 --> 03:59.110
We're live in the same courtyard, I'm not afraid of you running away.

03:59.110 --> 04:00.390
Pay me back when you have money.

04:00.390 --> 04:01.590
Don't pay it back if you don't.

04:02.910 --> 04:03.950
Thank Mr. Shao for me.

04:03.950 --> 04:05.550
Alright, go back.

04:07.070 --> 04:08.340
Siyi, you're here.

04:10.110 --> 04:11.020
Aunt Liang.

04:11.520 --> 04:13.410
Grandma asked me to bring 2,000 yuan here.

04:14.790 --> 04:16.230
Take it back.

04:17.180 --> 04:17.880
Take it back.

04:17.950 --> 04:19.149
Grandma said it's our sincerity.

04:19.149 --> 04:20.640
We got it.

04:20.750 --> 04:21.670
But bring the money back.

04:22.190 --> 04:23.150
Take it.

04:23.150 --> 04:23.990
Bring it back.

04:23.990 --> 04:24.990
Tell Grandma

04:24.990 --> 04:26.070
when I leave to drive the trucks,

04:26.070 --> 04:27.950
allow Wanghe to have meals at your place.

04:27.950 --> 04:29.510
We'd appreciate that.

04:29.510 --> 04:30.310
Yes.

04:30.310 --> 04:31.150
Take it.

04:31.150 --> 04:32.000
Bring it back.

04:32.000 --> 04:33.190
Siyi, they've got us.

04:33.300 --> 04:34.310
Go back and tell Grandma.

04:34.909 --> 04:36.310
We're here. Don't worry.

04:36.310 --> 04:37.480
Go back in.

04:37.580 --> 04:38.530
Be good.

04:38.750 --> 04:39.830
Reassure your grandma.

04:39.830 --> 04:41.710
They've got us, you don't have to do anything.

04:42.560 --> 04:43.270
Granny...

04:43.270 --> 04:44.420
Let's go back.

04:57.610 --> 04:58.970
That's all?

04:59.150 --> 05:01.600
It's about 100,000 yuan. There's a long way to go.

05:02.620 --> 05:03.740
Then let's

05:03.760 --> 05:04.980
borrow more.

05:05.510 --> 05:06.590
Anyway,

05:06.590 --> 05:07.720
I'll go drive with you.

05:07.740 --> 05:08.620
Let's earn it slowly.

05:08.620 --> 05:10.030
We can pay them back no matter what.

05:10.180 --> 05:12.100
I've borrowed everything I could.

05:12.600 --> 05:14.140
Who else can I look for?

05:25.660 --> 05:26.380
It's not enough.

05:26.400 --> 05:28.170
Can you give me another 20,000 yuan?

05:29.010 --> 05:30.830
I'm afraid you won't be able to pay back more than that.

05:31.170 --> 05:32.340
By driving the truck,

05:32.350 --> 05:33.880
I earn about 100,000

05:33.909 --> 05:35.350
I can make quite a lot of money.

05:35.390 --> 05:38.150
I'll pay you back the principal and interest together when the time comes.

05:38.150 --> 05:39.210
Not a penny less!

05:41.540 --> 05:43.420
It would be better if you had some collateral.

05:43.440 --> 05:45.000
It's not that I don't trust you,

05:45.030 --> 05:46.930
but I need to explain it to my family.

05:48.720 --> 05:49.520
How about this?

05:49.980 --> 05:50.930
At home,

05:51.020 --> 05:52.950
I have two pieces of gold jewelry.

05:53.130 --> 05:54.810
You can have them as collateral. How's that?

06:17.390 --> 06:18.300
Fly!

06:18.590 --> 06:19.510
Fly!

06:23.090 --> 06:23.980
Fly!

06:24.020 --> 06:24.940
Fly!

06:26.690 --> 06:28.930
The big plane is taking off!

06:32.340 --> 06:32.950
Grandma,

06:32.950 --> 06:35.030
I'll take you to fly over the Pacific Ocean.

06:35.070 --> 06:36.870
All right, let's fly over the Pacific Ocean.

06:36.900 --> 06:37.860
Play by yourself.

06:37.860 --> 06:39.790
I'm tired. I'll take a rest.

06:39.820 --> 06:40.230
Okay.

06:40.230 --> 06:41.030
Go play.

06:50.600 --> 06:51.830
I'm going to hit you!

06:52.270 --> 06:52.950
Fly!

06:53.030 --> 06:53.720
Fly!

07:01.270 --> 07:02.170
Fly!

07:02.430 --> 07:03.670
Fly!

07:15.920 --> 07:17.280
Take my

07:17.390 --> 07:18.310
punch!

07:21.390 --> 07:22.830
Take my kick!

07:23.180 --> 07:23.710
Oh no!

07:23.710 --> 07:25.450
My hand has fallen off.

07:25.530 --> 07:28.290
Lao'er even went to ask Fenghua's aunt.

07:28.820 --> 07:30.590
It's still not enough.

07:30.590 --> 07:33.140
We still have a lot to go despite adding it all together.

07:33.170 --> 07:34.480
They said

07:34.710 --> 07:36.070
they didn't have much money left.

07:36.070 --> 07:37.470
They said they're going to go borrow money.

07:37.470 --> 07:38.909
Who knows how much they can borrow?

07:38.909 --> 07:40.830
Don't borrow money from loan sharks.

07:40.850 --> 07:42.070
With the interest,

07:42.090 --> 07:44.180
you could go bankrupt.

07:44.320 --> 07:46.520
Haihong must have gone to borrow money.

07:46.560 --> 07:47.680
She can do anything

07:47.700 --> 07:49.380
for Wanghe.

07:49.420 --> 07:50.210
This morning,

07:50.230 --> 07:52.000
I saw her leave Flower Street.

07:52.040 --> 07:53.190
She was in a hurry.

07:54.790 --> 07:55.909
What should we do?

07:56.110 --> 07:57.830
I saw those who borrowed from loan sharks

07:57.850 --> 07:58.530
would have their houses

07:58.560 --> 08:00.320
taken away in the end.

08:00.340 --> 08:01.140
Those people

08:01.170 --> 08:03.020
have no conscience, they smash and burn everything.

08:03.050 --> 08:04.560
They can do anything.

08:04.790 --> 08:05.550
Exactly.

08:05.580 --> 08:07.390
One can never repay their high-interest loans.

08:07.420 --> 08:08.850
Even when Wanghe's released from jail,

08:08.890 --> 08:10.000
he'd still have to shoulder this debt.

08:10.030 --> 08:11.110
Then this child

08:11.130 --> 08:12.740
will be doomed.

08:12.770 --> 08:15.260
Wanghe only took on this matter for Fenghua's sake.

08:15.280 --> 08:16.800
Look at the mess we're in now.

08:17.990 --> 08:19.150
Watch this.

08:23.530 --> 08:24.970
How dare you hit me!

08:24.990 --> 08:27.280
Watch me turn into a fighter jet too!

08:34.150 --> 08:36.309
Siwei, Grandma is resting.

08:36.390 --> 08:38.390
I'll take you to Fenghua's house for some treats.

08:38.390 --> 08:39.110
Okay.

08:41.929 --> 08:44.010
To Fenghua's house!

09:06.160 --> 09:07.390
Can you keep an eye on him for me?

09:07.390 --> 09:08.600
I need to go out and take care of something.

09:09.150 --> 09:10.310
Make sure you do your homework properly.

09:10.930 --> 09:11.960
What are you going to do?

09:12.270 --> 09:13.150
Grandma is sick.

09:13.150 --> 09:14.030
She can't cook.

09:14.070 --> 09:15.460
You're in charge of his dinner.

09:19.670 --> 09:20.600
Sister.

09:31.980 --> 09:32.810
Siyi.

09:33.160 --> 09:33.950
What's wrong?

09:37.320 --> 09:41.060
Is your offer to lend me money still valid?

09:41.410 --> 09:42.580
Of course, it still stands.

09:43.530 --> 09:44.830
I have over 30,000 in my account.

09:44.870 --> 09:45.510
How much do you need?

09:46.190 --> 09:47.090
20,000.

09:47.280 --> 09:48.720
I'll pay you back with bank interest later.

09:48.740 --> 09:49.270
No need.

09:49.710 --> 09:50.780
No, I've already–

09:50.810 --> 09:51.770
Let's do it your way, okay?

09:51.830 --> 09:52.790
All right, I'll go get my card.

09:52.810 --> 09:53.570
Wait for me.

09:56.680 --> 09:57.520
Sis.

09:59.700 --> 10:00.320
Sis?

10:02.440 --> 10:04.240
Fenghua!

10:08.090 --> 10:09.770
I want to go see a movie.

10:09.800 --> 10:11.120
"Iron Man."

10:11.150 --> 10:12.220
It's interesting.

10:12.440 --> 10:14.230
Everyone in my class has seen it.

10:14.250 --> 10:15.910
I'm the only one who hasn't.

10:16.740 --> 10:18.100
Have you finished your homework?

10:18.120 --> 10:19.610
Yes, I have.

10:20.520 --> 10:21.550
Let's go then.

10:21.600 --> 10:23.600
I'm going to see "Iron Man"!

10:23.620 --> 10:24.780
Hurry up!

10:24.810 --> 10:26.020
Slow down, slow down.

10:26.200 --> 10:29.190
Sister, the Iron Man in there...

10:37.670 --> 10:38.500
Ms. Liang.

10:39.580 --> 10:40.830
Please take this money.

10:40.850 --> 10:42.090
Get Wanghe out quickly.

10:42.120 --> 10:43.120
We can't let this affect his college entrance exam.

10:50.420 --> 10:52.200
Where did you get so much money?

10:52.500 --> 10:53.440
I didn't steal nor rob,

10:53.470 --> 10:53.990
don't worry.

10:54.010 --> 10:55.870
It's within my personal means.

10:58.750 --> 10:59.730
No.

10:59.770 --> 11:02.350
You must explain clearly where this money came from.

11:04.190 --> 11:05.150
Ms. Liang,

11:05.170 --> 11:07.480
Wanghe's grades have improved rapidly recently.

11:07.590 --> 11:08.650
If nothing goes wrong,

11:08.690 --> 11:09.920
he will definitely get into college.

11:10.390 --> 11:10.990
At this time,

11:10.990 --> 11:12.910
freedom is the most important thing for him.

11:18.680 --> 11:20.000
You don't need to see me out, Ms. Liang.

11:20.000 --> 11:20.910
I'll be going now.

11:22.110 --> 11:23.100
Get some rest early.

11:32.890 --> 11:33.730
Grandma.

11:34.500 --> 11:35.550
I'm back.

11:38.730 --> 11:40.050
Grandma, have you had dinner yet?

11:45.500 --> 11:46.350
Grandma?

11:51.360 --> 11:52.470
Grandma!

11:56.820 --> 11:57.940
Granny.

12:10.590 --> 12:14.040
[Police]

12:22.110 --> 12:22.960
Thank you.

12:24.870 --> 12:32.890
[If you admit your mistake, you can turn over a new leaf.]

12:33.840 --> 12:34.350
Uncle.

12:34.860 --> 12:35.530
I'm sorry.

12:34.960 --> 12:36.720
[If you admit your mistake, you can turn over a new leaf.]

12:39.260 --> 12:42.010
You need to use your brain when you do things in the future.

12:41.880 --> 12:45.140
[If you admit your mistake, you can turn over a new leaf.]

12:44.990 --> 12:45.470
Go on.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.510
They're waiting for you at home.

12:47.850 --> 12:49.770
Don't worry about Fenghua.

12:50.050 --> 12:51.030
We've watched him

12:51.030 --> 12:52.900
delete all the photos in his records,

12:52.930 --> 12:55.180
and punished him according to the law.

13:00.530 --> 13:05.230
[Police]

13:14.070 --> 13:14.800
Wanghe.

13:18.670 --> 13:19.990
Have a good talk with your father when you get home.

13:20.550 --> 13:21.680
Don't make him angry.

13:23.570 --> 13:24.370
Thank you, Uncle.

13:49.570 --> 13:50.330
Where's your uncle?

13:51.810 --> 13:53.660
He said he had something to do and left early.

13:55.630 --> 13:56.430
Dad.

13:57.720 --> 13:58.520
Mom.

13:59.450 --> 14:00.290
I'm sorry.

14:00.620 --> 14:02.610
I've caused trouble for the family again.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.670
Sit down and eat.

14:09.500 --> 14:10.900
Sit down, sit down.

14:21.040 --> 14:21.970
Come on.

14:25.420 --> 14:26.230
Thank you, Dad.

14:27.530 --> 14:29.280
I'm not used to the food inside.

14:38.620 --> 14:40.110
You should eat too, Mom and Dad.

14:41.980 --> 14:42.970
In the future,

14:45.470 --> 14:46.820
before you do anything,

14:47.110 --> 14:48.630
you need to use your head.

14:49.750 --> 14:51.660
You can't be so impulsive anymore.

14:52.990 --> 14:54.590
For your college entrance exam,

14:54.970 --> 14:56.370
we had to pay that Pang Dahai

14:56.890 --> 14:58.500
100,000 yuan in compensation.

15:00.920 --> 15:01.920
100,000?

15:03.320 --> 15:05.150
On what grounds?

15:05.180 --> 15:07.110
Do you know what that bastard did?

15:07.230 --> 15:08.110
If we didn't pay the 100,000,

15:08.230 --> 15:09.550
they would refuse mediation,

15:09.570 --> 15:12.360
and you would...

15:13.190 --> 15:14.710
You would be kept in there.

15:14.730 --> 15:16.130
It would affect your college entrance exam.

15:16.160 --> 15:17.570
So what?

15:17.930 --> 15:19.390
Let them keep me locked up!

15:19.410 --> 15:20.220
I'll stay in jail!

15:20.250 --> 15:21.990
What are they going to do, execute me?

15:22.040 --> 15:23.040
I'd rather die

15:23.070 --> 15:25.220
than bow down to these thugs and scoundrels!

15:25.660 --> 15:27.220
Can you be mature?

15:29.070 --> 15:31.150
Isn't that what you taught me, Dad?

15:31.670 --> 15:33.680
You said a person should have a sense of responsibility.

15:33.710 --> 15:35.870
Yes, I was impulsive this time,

15:35.910 --> 15:37.640
but my intentions were good.

15:37.670 --> 15:39.660
If you back down from these thugs,

15:39.660 --> 15:41.600
they'll just take advantage of it!

15:41.710 --> 15:42.670
Enough!

16:31.350 --> 16:33.030
You really know where to go.

16:37.420 --> 16:38.140
I'm not hungry.

16:51.710 --> 16:53.190
At the end of the day,

16:53.510 --> 16:54.830
it's really my fault.

16:57.400 --> 16:58.330
You

17:00.630 --> 17:01.990
are quite like me when I was young.

17:04.359 --> 17:07.390
I did a lot of stupid things back then,

17:07.670 --> 17:08.980
and was even proud of it.

17:09.530 --> 17:10.770
Standing up for justice, huh?

17:16.079 --> 17:17.089
Well,

17:17.700 --> 17:18.829
you did that

17:19.099 --> 17:20.430
for your friend too.

17:21.140 --> 17:22.180
To prevent them from being wronged,

17:22.890 --> 17:23.990
you resorted to violence

17:24.270 --> 17:25.390
without considering the consequences.

17:28.510 --> 17:30.900
This is a problem that needs to be solved.

17:38.500 --> 17:39.470
Dad,

17:41.020 --> 17:42.460
I was impulsive this time,

17:44.640 --> 17:46.350
but I don't think I was wrong.

17:47.190 --> 17:50.530
That bastard bullied Fenghua

17:50.550 --> 17:51.900
and uploaded those photos.

17:52.410 --> 17:53.660
If I were a coward,

17:53.700 --> 17:55.490
who knows what might happen in the future?

17:58.020 --> 17:59.830
So I absolutely refuse to bow down to such people.

18:01.360 --> 18:03.400
I was protecting my family and friends.

18:03.430 --> 18:04.310
Was I wrong?

18:16.130 --> 18:17.890
To compensate them that 100,000,

18:18.680 --> 18:19.700
the neighbors

18:20.140 --> 18:21.270
chipped in.

18:22.750 --> 18:23.830
We also

18:24.840 --> 18:25.680
borrowed

18:26.160 --> 18:27.160
some money

18:29.070 --> 18:30.270
but it still wasn't enough.

18:33.350 --> 18:35.510
After Siyi learned about this,

18:36.500 --> 18:37.800
she ran out

18:38.310 --> 18:40.030
to borrow money from her classmate.

18:42.610 --> 18:43.960
By the time she came back,

18:46.460 --> 18:48.450
Granny Ma had already passed away.

18:49.970 --> 18:51.250
It was cerebral hemorrhage.

18:52.380 --> 18:53.870
Because there was no one around,

18:54.240 --> 18:56.790
she didn't get timely rescue.

18:57.880 --> 18:59.220
I feel...

19:09.840 --> 19:11.780
Grow up quickly.

19:12.860 --> 19:15.090
Your mother and I are old.

19:15.910 --> 19:17.820
We can't keep up with your antics anymore.

20:00.290 --> 20:01.300
Eat up.

20:02.950 --> 20:04.060
I'm not hungry.

20:04.090 --> 20:05.650
You haven't eaten for a whole day.

20:06.260 --> 20:07.440
Hurry up.

20:07.790 --> 20:09.550
I said I'm not hungry.

21:01.110 --> 21:02.330
Grandma.

21:05.580 --> 21:06.710
I'm back.

21:10.390 --> 21:11.440
The doctor said

21:12.880 --> 21:14.320
Grandma passed away in her sleep.

21:15.500 --> 21:16.380
She left peacefully.

21:18.300 --> 21:19.960
Last night,

21:21.590 --> 21:22.590
I dreamed about Grandma.

21:24.870 --> 21:26.300
She told me

21:27.100 --> 21:28.340
she's been very tired lately

21:29.060 --> 21:30.330
and wanted to take a break.

21:31.860 --> 21:32.980
She asked me not to blame her.

21:35.530 --> 21:37.350
I knew it was a dream,

21:38.640 --> 21:40.350
so I told her in the dream

21:41.290 --> 21:42.330
not to leave.

21:45.870 --> 21:47.490
But she left anyway.

21:55.230 --> 21:56.960
I just went out for a moment,

21:58.100 --> 22:00.300
how could I lose my grandma just like that?

22:35.850 --> 22:36.490
Dad...

22:37.730 --> 22:38.630
Mom...

22:39.700 --> 22:40.670
I'm sorry.

22:42.460 --> 22:43.690
I was wrong.

22:52.460 --> 22:54.810
I'm sorry, I was wrong.

22:58.270 --> 22:59.210
This matter,

23:01.240 --> 23:02.950
at the very bottom of it,

23:04.450 --> 23:06.150
is your responsibility.

23:11.550 --> 23:12.630
From now on,

23:13.750 --> 23:15.310
be better to Siyi.

23:16.800 --> 23:19.210
Do your best in this lifetime

23:20.180 --> 23:22.260
to spare her from suffering.

23:24.930 --> 23:27.520
This is what you owe Granny Ma.

23:48.800 --> 23:50.050
Don't cry anymore.

23:50.880 --> 23:51.950
Go to bed early.

23:53.310 --> 23:55.390
You have school early tomorrow morning.

23:56.830 --> 23:58.820
I feel terrible inside.

23:59.700 --> 24:00.800
We all do.

24:04.910 --> 24:06.630
All these years, Granny Ma

24:08.760 --> 24:10.580
has been so good to us.

24:11.090 --> 24:12.580
She left so suddenly.

24:14.680 --> 24:18.050
We didn't even have a chance to be good to her.

24:21.370 --> 24:22.470
That day...

24:24.030 --> 24:25.950
Siyi asked me to watch her place...

24:27.860 --> 24:29.650
I didn't take it seriously...

24:30.820 --> 24:33.050
I even took Siwei to watch a movie.

24:35.360 --> 24:37.230
If we had been at home,

24:38.150 --> 24:40.030
Granny Ma wouldn't have passed away...

24:42.600 --> 24:43.990
Don't think like that.

24:46.060 --> 24:48.880
Cerebral hemorrhage is very dangerous to begin with.

24:49.930 --> 24:51.800
Even if we had taken her to the hospital,

24:51.840 --> 24:53.640
we might not have been able to save her.

24:58.560 --> 25:01.430
At least there would have been a glimmer of hope.

25:03.820 --> 25:05.600
It's all my fault.

25:06.210 --> 25:09.680
I shouldn't have gone out.

25:16.550 --> 25:18.150
Don't cry.

25:56.350 --> 25:57.460
Sister.

25:58.120 --> 25:59.120
I'm hungry.

26:00.110 --> 26:02.430
There are instant noodles. Make it yourself.

26:02.890 --> 26:04.490
I don't want instant noodles.

26:04.510 --> 26:05.830
They give me a stomachache.

26:29.520 --> 26:31.330
Go buy something to eat yourself.

26:32.150 --> 26:33.390
Are you eating?

26:34.270 --> 26:35.020
I'm not hungry.

26:36.590 --> 26:39.990
But you haven't eaten for two days.

26:47.610 --> 26:48.620
Go and come back quickly.

26:49.790 --> 26:51.040
Sis,

26:51.190 --> 26:53.590
please go and eat something with me.

26:56.580 --> 26:57.670
Fine.

26:57.990 --> 26:59.510
I'll go eat by myself then.

27:03.730 --> 27:04.500
Hello, Grandpa.

27:33.740 --> 27:36.420
Go to the shop for a bowl of eel noodles later.

27:36.610 --> 27:37.770
You can't keep starving yourself.

27:39.350 --> 27:40.400
No need.

27:41.060 --> 27:41.960
I'm not hungry yet.

27:43.080 --> 27:44.310
Thank you, Grandpa Zhou.

27:45.910 --> 27:47.270
If you get hungry,

27:50.250 --> 27:53.080
your grandma will come to our dreams and scold us.

27:56.260 --> 27:57.470
She wouldn't do that.

27:57.930 --> 27:59.160
Who says she wouldn't?

27:59.680 --> 28:00.430
Don't you remember?

28:01.920 --> 28:03.030
That year,

28:03.350 --> 28:04.990
when you and Wanghe went down to the river

28:05.370 --> 28:06.370
to learn how to swim

28:06.740 --> 28:08.020
and choked on some water,

28:09.140 --> 28:10.850
someone mimicked it to your grandma

28:12.140 --> 28:14.120
and it made her so mad.

28:14.140 --> 28:18.450
She went door to door scolding everyone, young and old.

28:19.590 --> 28:22.670
None of us had a peaceful meal that day.

28:24.480 --> 28:27.030
I remember Wanghe and Haikuo both got hit.

28:27.730 --> 28:30.800
Xiaopang ran away from home after just two hits.

28:32.190 --> 28:33.790
That incident scared me too.

28:34.620 --> 28:36.670
You were your grandma's soft spot.

28:41.770 --> 28:42.740
Except for her,

28:43.490 --> 28:44.660
no one could touch you.

28:47.780 --> 28:48.980
Last month,

28:49.860 --> 28:50.880
on a night,

28:53.110 --> 28:55.350
your grandma suddenly came to my house.

28:57.650 --> 28:58.780
Mr. Zhou,

28:59.550 --> 29:00.860
I

29:01.210 --> 29:03.970
have had someone write a power of attorney. Have a look.

29:07.330 --> 29:10.590
In case I...

29:11.790 --> 29:14.220
I'll have to trouble you...

29:14.350 --> 29:16.270
to help me sell that house.

29:16.620 --> 29:18.830
You can keep the money,

29:18.910 --> 29:20.950
and you can give it to Siyi monthly.

29:21.060 --> 29:24.770
We must ensure Siyi finishes university, no matter what.

29:24.910 --> 29:26.440
If...

29:27.400 --> 29:29.340
If this money isn't enough,

29:32.540 --> 29:33.540
then

29:34.630 --> 29:36.830
I'll have to trouble everyone.

29:40.310 --> 29:42.140
I'm sorry to everyone.

29:46.160 --> 29:46.980
I...

29:48.450 --> 29:52.240
I can only repay this in my next life.

30:03.050 --> 30:04.250
I'm counting on you.

30:12.380 --> 30:15.990
We'll talk about whether we have to sell the house later.

30:18.290 --> 30:20.740
This time, I represent

30:20.760 --> 30:23.370
the neighbors from this courtyard

30:23.720 --> 30:25.370
to tell you that you

30:26.950 --> 30:29.900
don't need to worry about money.

30:30.190 --> 30:31.780
Even if you study for a doctorate,

30:32.340 --> 30:33.630
we'll support you.

30:38.710 --> 30:39.700
I know

30:40.320 --> 30:42.000
if this happened to another family,

30:42.030 --> 30:43.840
and if another child was left alone,

30:44.040 --> 30:45.820
as long as Granny Ma was around,

30:46.690 --> 30:49.030
even if she had scrimp and save,

30:49.780 --> 30:51.460
she wouldn't stand by and watch.

30:56.520 --> 30:57.920
We all know

30:59.040 --> 31:01.210
you're independent and strong-willed,

31:02.120 --> 31:03.330
but

31:03.350 --> 31:04.930
you should accept everyone's kindness

31:05.340 --> 31:06.940
on behalf of

31:06.960 --> 31:07.750
your grandma.

31:11.920 --> 31:13.340
From this moment on,

31:14.350 --> 31:15.240
you,

31:15.740 --> 31:16.910
Ma Siyi,

31:17.820 --> 31:19.320
are the child

31:20.400 --> 31:21.870
of all of us.

31:29.070 --> 31:30.590
Grandpa Zhou...

31:43.110 --> 31:44.260
Look, look.

31:44.520 --> 31:45.230
What are you doing?

31:45.260 --> 31:45.750
Shoo.

31:45.910 --> 31:47.210
Don't cause trouble here.

31:47.280 --> 31:48.140
Go over there.

31:57.870 --> 31:58.710
You messed it up.

32:02.520 --> 32:03.530
You're back?

32:05.150 --> 32:06.020
How did it go?

32:06.240 --> 32:06.830
How was it?

32:08.910 --> 32:09.770
Mr. Zhou.

32:11.830 --> 32:14.100
I've talked to Siyi.

32:15.810 --> 32:18.190
Her emotions were relatively stable.

32:18.520 --> 32:19.600
So,

32:20.820 --> 32:21.780
later,

32:22.590 --> 32:23.840
everyone should pay more attention.

32:23.860 --> 32:25.230
Communicate with her regularly.

32:25.250 --> 32:26.670
It's the last semester.

32:27.190 --> 32:28.190
It's crucial.

32:29.170 --> 32:31.260
We must not let it affect her grades.

32:31.590 --> 32:33.020
Siyi is a good child.

32:33.050 --> 32:34.640
She has always been sensible.

32:34.670 --> 32:36.330
If it were just her alone,

32:36.350 --> 32:37.710
there's no need to worry.

32:37.730 --> 32:38.770
But she has

32:38.990 --> 32:40.270
a younger brother.

32:41.290 --> 32:43.810
Someone needs to pick him up from school.

32:43.910 --> 32:45.460
She has to cook when they get home.

32:45.470 --> 32:47.030
And help with his homework.

32:49.160 --> 32:50.970
I feel for this child just thinking about it.

32:52.350 --> 32:54.620
Siyi is still just a teenager herself.

32:54.650 --> 32:56.480
It's not easy for her to take care of herself,

32:56.520 --> 32:57.440
let alone look after her brother,

32:57.460 --> 32:58.510
and preparing for the college entrance exam.

32:58.570 --> 32:59.850
It's definitely too much.

33:01.520 --> 33:02.440
Actually, if you ask me,

33:04.750 --> 33:07.250
we should all try to persuade Siyi's mother

33:07.270 --> 33:09.430
to take Ge Siwei back with her first.

33:09.460 --> 33:11.540
At least for this semester.

33:12.070 --> 33:13.540
We can't let this affect Siyi's studies.

33:14.590 --> 33:15.960
What if she refuses?

33:16.110 --> 33:17.950
That mother of hers

33:18.470 --> 33:19.910
is not a good person.

33:20.990 --> 33:22.070
How can you talk like that?

33:22.640 --> 33:23.590
No matter what,

33:23.590 --> 33:24.710
they're still her own children.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.080
When Granny was around,

33:26.120 --> 33:26.710
she left him here.

33:26.820 --> 33:27.750
Now that she's gone,

33:27.790 --> 33:30.130
she still won't take care of her own son?

33:30.150 --> 33:31.580
You never know.

33:31.910 --> 33:33.110
Given the old lady's situation before,

33:33.110 --> 33:34.630
she still had the nerve to come asking for money.

33:34.650 --> 33:36.410
That's right, she was extorting the old lady.

33:36.440 --> 33:37.560
As if the old lady owed her something.

33:37.610 --> 33:38.510
Exactly.

33:38.530 --> 33:39.180
Well then,

33:40.420 --> 33:42.130
let's see her attitude first.

33:42.800 --> 33:44.020
If she's friendly,

33:45.080 --> 33:46.760
we'll be polite to her.

33:47.310 --> 33:47.950
Right?

33:48.990 --> 33:50.740
Let's try not to fall out with her.

33:51.110 --> 33:51.740
Yes, yes.

33:52.170 --> 33:54.560
If she's unreasonable,

33:56.290 --> 33:57.240
we'll pressure her together.

33:58.940 --> 34:01.030
We won't let her bully the children.

34:01.510 --> 34:02.320
-Yes.
-Yes.

34:02.790 --> 34:03.380
Exactly.

34:05.200 --> 34:07.550
Siyi can't keep pushing herself like this.

34:07.570 --> 34:10.290
If she continues like this, her health will collapse.

34:11.320 --> 34:12.600
I've tried to persuade her, but she won't listen.

34:13.540 --> 34:14.710
My mom told her to go back to sleep,

34:15.810 --> 34:17.900
but she got up again after lying down for just a moment.

34:18.530 --> 34:19.610
She stays up all night when she does that.

34:20.830 --> 34:21.480
If this continues,

34:21.510 --> 34:22.590
her health will definitely deteriorate.

34:29.000 --> 34:30.420
Did you see Granny

34:31.630 --> 34:32.480
before she passed?

34:34.120 --> 34:34.940
No.

34:39.030 --> 34:40.639
By the time we found out, she was already gone.

34:51.620 --> 34:52.739
We won't be able to eat

34:54.630 --> 34:56.110
those fried radish cakes anymore.

35:04.550 --> 35:06.520
Who knew this would happen?

35:50.440 --> 35:58.050
[Qi Meiyun's Funeral]

36:06.370 --> 36:08.790
[End]

36:10.140 --> 36:11.830
Mom!

36:14.210 --> 36:15.490
Mom.

36:17.720 --> 36:19.330
Mom...

36:21.350 --> 36:22.550
Mom...

36:25.270 --> 36:27.280
I'm back.

36:29.110 --> 36:30.150
Mom...

36:30.780 --> 36:32.100
Why did you

36:32.980 --> 36:34.220
just leave?

36:39.830 --> 36:41.240
Mom...

36:47.010 --> 36:54.440
[Qi Meiyun's Funeral]

36:47.200 --> 36:50.760
I'm home, Mom!

36:54.590 --> 36:58.290
[Rest in Peace]

36:58.350 --> 36:59.630
She was just fine.

37:01.240 --> 37:03.350
How could she pass away just like that?

37:05.350 --> 37:06.260
Cerebral hemorrhage.

37:07.740 --> 37:09.470
No one was around when it happened.

37:10.220 --> 37:11.340
It was too late for emergency treatment.

37:12.590 --> 37:14.790
How could you be so careless?

37:14.960 --> 37:15.990
As people get older,

37:16.030 --> 37:17.030
they shouldn't be left alone.

37:17.090 --> 37:18.240
Don't you know that?

37:21.380 --> 37:22.610
What are your plans now?

37:23.550 --> 37:25.040
It's your last semester.

37:25.700 --> 37:26.980
Can you get into college?

37:27.770 --> 37:28.450
I should be able to.

37:29.820 --> 37:30.670
What about the tuition?

37:32.970 --> 37:34.500
I'm applying to Honghuai Normal University.

37:34.520 --> 37:35.830
It's tuition-free.

37:36.430 --> 37:38.480
Um, Siyi's mom.

37:39.560 --> 37:42.290
You are? Mr. Zhou?

37:42.900 --> 37:44.260
We came to check on you.

37:44.790 --> 37:46.410
Siyi told me everything.

37:46.430 --> 37:47.710
She said how kind you were to her

37:47.740 --> 37:49.720
and to my mother-in-law.

37:50.150 --> 37:51.170
I'm truly...

37:51.450 --> 37:52.620
Let's not say too much about it.

37:52.790 --> 37:54.540
It's what neighbors should do.

37:54.570 --> 37:56.010
Please, have a seat.

37:56.040 --> 37:56.990
Don't stand on ceremony, sit down.

37:57.030 --> 37:58.270
Have a seat.

38:01.150 --> 38:02.250
Go get some water.

38:15.360 --> 38:16.280
Siyi's mom.

38:18.280 --> 38:20.680
What are your plans for the child?

38:27.110 --> 38:29.620
I want to take Siwei away.

38:29.820 --> 38:31.020
Siyi will stay here.

38:31.150 --> 38:33.130
The college entrance exam is coming up soon, right?

38:33.740 --> 38:35.210
I'll stay here to keep her company for now.

38:35.250 --> 38:36.010
There's no need.

38:36.140 --> 38:37.630
Just take good care of Brother.

38:39.560 --> 38:41.470
I'm worried about you.

38:41.490 --> 38:42.890
You had Granny before,

38:42.960 --> 38:44.830
you could look after each other.

38:44.860 --> 38:46.430
Now that Granny is gone,

38:46.980 --> 38:47.690
what about you?

38:48.150 --> 38:49.400
How will you manage in the future?

38:49.430 --> 38:50.110
Siyi's mom.

38:50.620 --> 38:52.060
Actually, regarding Siyi,

38:52.900 --> 38:54.100
you can rest assured.

38:54.800 --> 38:56.190
We neighbors treat her

38:56.230 --> 38:57.430
like our own child.

38:58.270 --> 38:59.870
And we pay about

38:59.910 --> 39:01.750
a little over a thousand for rent every month.

39:02.340 --> 39:04.740
We've also set up a small fund.

39:05.200 --> 39:06.050
It means

39:06.890 --> 39:08.160
Before the kids work,

39:08.190 --> 39:10.350
we'll take care of her living expenses.

39:11.220 --> 39:13.220
Including her college tuition if she gets in.

39:13.250 --> 39:14.660
So you don't need to worry too much.

39:17.420 --> 39:19.690
My mother-in-law is really lucky

39:19.740 --> 39:21.890
to have such wonderful neighbors like you.

39:22.260 --> 39:24.510
Granny Ma has been so good to us all these years.

39:24.790 --> 39:26.160
We're like family.

39:26.700 --> 39:27.540
As human beings,

39:27.560 --> 39:29.410
we should always be grateful and repay kindness.

39:29.450 --> 39:30.070
Right?

39:30.310 --> 39:31.270
Yes, yes, absolutely.

39:31.470 --> 39:32.640
This kindness

39:32.790 --> 39:34.430
will be remembered in our hearts for a lifetime.

39:35.310 --> 39:37.270
Siyi, quickly thank Uncle and Auntie.

39:40.080 --> 39:41.170
No need, no need.

39:41.230 --> 39:42.510
It's nothing, really.

39:42.540 --> 39:43.180
Really, there's no need.

39:43.180 --> 39:43.950
Look at this child.

39:44.810 --> 39:46.340
We're heading back.

39:47.160 --> 39:47.880
It's really...

39:47.910 --> 39:48.630
Don't see me off.

39:48.630 --> 39:50.510
I couldn't even do that as her mother,

39:50.550 --> 39:53.030
but you neighbors have thought of everything for me.

39:53.060 --> 39:54.230
I'm truly so grateful.

39:54.230 --> 39:55.270
I don't want to go.

40:03.230 --> 40:04.310
Siyi.

40:04.880 --> 40:06.830
Mom knows they're good to you,

40:08.230 --> 40:08.920
but

40:08.960 --> 40:11.670
they're still outsiders, aren't they?

40:11.830 --> 40:15.070
They can be nice to you for a few days,

40:15.340 --> 40:17.660
but they can't be nice forever, can they?

40:17.900 --> 40:18.940
Right?

40:23.510 --> 40:24.670
What are you up to this time?

40:25.320 --> 40:27.190
What can I do?

40:27.350 --> 40:28.910
I'm your mother,

40:28.910 --> 40:30.200
not your enemy.

40:30.330 --> 40:31.860
Can't you be a little nicer to me?

40:34.720 --> 40:35.610
I'm tired.

40:36.020 --> 40:36.610
Do as you please.

40:39.690 --> 40:40.880
Heartless.

40:43.260 --> 40:44.860
Heartless and unfeeling child.

40:50.930 --> 40:53.340
♫Stepping on the old time♫

40:54.470 --> 40:57.550
♫The wind blows gently♫

40:58.600 --> 41:02.460
♫It blows through the the forest and the city♫

41:04.050 --> 41:06.560
♫It blows across your face♫

41:04.670 --> 41:08.350
♫Originally♫

41:07.670 --> 41:15.490
[Breakfast]

41:07.840 --> 41:11.130
♫And my heart♫

41:08.950 --> 41:13.790
♫The purple♫

41:12.530 --> 41:15.030
♫The wind blows gently♫

41:16.120 --> 41:18.400
♫Blowing through summer♫

41:16.950 --> 41:21.350
♫And red blossoms♫

41:19.100 --> 41:21.630
♫Blowing through the eaves♫

41:21.830 --> 41:26.590
♫Bloom everywhere♫

41:22.670 --> 41:24.620
♫It blows past me♫

41:25.910 --> 41:29.530
♫My warm love♫

41:30.300 --> 41:31.550
♫How many years♫

41:30.390 --> 41:31.390
Siyi.

41:30.530 --> 41:31.720
[Breakfast]

41:32.580 --> 41:36.010
♫Have you changed?♫

41:33.250 --> 41:33.960
Grandma...

41:34.100 --> 41:34.940
Siyi.

41:36.800 --> 41:39.530
The government gave us low income payouts.

41:37.280 --> 41:38.890
♫How many years♫

41:39.680 --> 41:42.770
♫How far has the old times♫

41:39.780 --> 41:42.300
And the neighbors take care of us.

41:43.150 --> 41:44.440
But

41:44.080 --> 41:45.870
♫We miss gone♫

41:45.010 --> 41:47.380
you must never rely on others' means.

41:46.800 --> 41:50.270
♫I was lost in a distance♫

41:47.710 --> 41:48.670
Understand?

41:48.690 --> 41:49.570
Yes.

41:51.280 --> 41:52.950
♫I couldn't forget♫

41:53.840 --> 41:57.420
♫The first growth♫

41:54.940 --> 41:57.290
So from now on,

41:58.010 --> 42:00.040
I'll teach you how to cook.

42:01.000 --> 42:04.270
Because I don't know how long I can stay with you.

42:05.560 --> 42:07.420
I'll teach you how to cook.

42:07.440 --> 42:09.200
I'll teach you how to fry fried radish cakes

42:09.670 --> 42:12.790
and teach you how to make a living.

42:13.180 --> 42:15.380
Even if grandma is gone,

42:16.630 --> 42:19.910
you can still rely on this skill to support yourself.

42:20.120 --> 42:20.750
Okay?

42:22.060 --> 42:22.890
Okay...

42:36.380 --> 42:37.290
Siyi.

42:38.000 --> 42:38.870
What would you like to eat?

42:38.900 --> 42:40.300
Come over, child.

42:58.410 --> 43:04.100
♫Thinking of you deeply♫
